@swf2es/native/render: lyon, the crates it uses, and Rust's core and alloc
==========================================================================

src/render/lyon/libswf2es_tessellate.a, linked into the render module, is
https://github.com/swf2es/tessellate's release v0.1.2, built by its CI. It holds
lyon's fill tessellator and the code below; the release's notices follow.

Third-party code compiled into libswf2es_tessellate.a, each notice
verbatim. The crate's own code is under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE).

Of the crates Cargo.lock names, autocfg runs only at build time and puts
nothing into the library, and of the dual-licensed ones below each is used
under the MIT license.

